      "name": "Context Menu",
      "id": "3452:13",
      "description": "Floating menu triggered by right-click or long-press. Anchored to the pointer position; clamps to viewport edges. Holds Context Menu Items and dividers. Dismisses on outside click, Escape, or item selection. Focus-trapped while open. Use for object-specific actions; for toolbar-triggered actions, use Dropdown Menu.",
