  "frames": [],
  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Context Menu",
    "Description",
    "A right-click triggered floating menu of actions. Shares the same item anatomy as Dropdown Menu but is activated via contextual interaction rather than a button trigger. Use for canvas object actions, file management, and contextual operations.",
    "Sub-Components",
    "Menu Item       An individual action row with optional leading icon and keyboard shortcut.\nMenu Divider   A thin horizontal line separating groups of related actions.\nMenu Panel      The container holding items, with elevation and border.",
    "States",
    "default            Item is idle and interactive.\nhover              Pointer is over the item.\nfocus               Item has keyboard focus.\ndisabled          Item is visible but not actionable.\ndestructive     Irreversible action — label and icon use danger tokens.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Group related actions with dividers\nDO   Place destructive actions at the bottom\nDO   Include keyboard shortcuts for power users\nDO   Keep to one level of nesting (no sub-menus)",
    "DON'T   Use for primary navigation — use Sidebar or Tab Bar\nDON'T   Show more than 10 items without grouping\nDON'T   Mix destructive and safe actions in the same group\nDON'T   Disable items without explanation via tooltip"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
